WEBVTT

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.260
He's late.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.290
Tomorrow morning. The meeting point will be in front of the Wynnit dumpling shop.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.020
He's late!

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:51.100
Ryner! How long do you plan to stay asleep?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:38.380
Captain Milk... It doesn't look like she's been back to her room since yesterday!

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.570
Could she have gone away without taking leave?

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:45.940
No way! The Captain would never do that!

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:49.210
It couldn't be...

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.850
Luke, sir!

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:57.160
What should we do?

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.020
Stay calm.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.180
It's possible that the Captain could be...

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.870
Do you have some idea about this?

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:07.620
She could be with Ryner Lute.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:14.250
You mustn't! Please wait a moment!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.080
Going in with a sword...

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:20.670
Ferris?

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:31.120
I'm sorry! I tried to stop her, but...

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:34.280
Relax. She's an acquaintance of mine.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:36.450
Of Your Majesty's?

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.220
But...

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.420
On that note, Eslina.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.210
Everything's fine, so if you could leave?

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:45.030
A-Ah, right.

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:51.160
Well? What's this all about?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.710
Ryner has disappeared.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.510
I see.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.180
Neither of you cared for the idea of going to Estabul as my escort,

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.670
so you planned to flee together.

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:09.140
But Ryner never showed up at the arranged place.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:10.440
Right.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.600
Maybe he wound up wanting to ditch the dumpling tour with you as well?

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.570
There was nothing odd about him?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.140
Not a thing.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:24.610
But apparently he met with Brother yesterday.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.080
With Lucile?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.990
Before coming here, I paid a visit to the manor.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:34.340
I thought that Ryner might have been there.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.460
What did he go there to do?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.380
I don't know.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.730
Brother wouldn't tell me, either.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.270
Lucile! What happened between you and Ryner?!

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.540
Ryner has vanished?

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.540
He promised me.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.490
That he would carry the dumplings for me...

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.360
He promised that.

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:14.830
Sir Sion!

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:20.880
Whoa, what a hottie! Come on, Sir Sion, introduce me!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.670
What are you...?

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.480
Didn't you have a notification for His Majesty?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:31.340
Oh, right. A report arrived from Sir Claugh in Estabul.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.430
From Claugh?

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:38.290
An Alpha Stigma bearer has appeared in Estabul,

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.230
and has caused a considerable amount of damage, it seems.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:45.230
Claugh has gathered Roland and Estabul forces and set out to subdue the threat.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.570
Don't tell me it's... Ryner?

00:05:48.340 --> 00:05:51.950
That would be impossible. Ryner's disappearance was this morning.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:56.600
Against an Alpha Stigma, even Sir Claugh wouldn't have it easy.

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:59.730
I'll head for Estabul and support Claugh.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:03.380
I'll need to ensure that the Alpha Stigma bearer also gets secured without dying.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.500
Secured?!

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.180
Opportunities to learn more about the Alpha Stigma don't come often.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.840
Ferris. I'll entrust the search for Ryner to you.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.830
Use these two as you see fit.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:14.760
Indeed.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.100
There's no mistaking it.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:27.190
He's someone who appears from time to time in our territory and attacks our citizens.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:30.820
Black hair and black clothes.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:35.370
Black eyes with a glowing vermilion pattern.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:39.960
And even worse, this Alpha Stigma monster consumes people.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.510
The field marshal of the Roland Empire,

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:51.470
who deceived our princess and stole our kingdom...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:54.220
Let us bear witness to your power.

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.720
Black hair... Black clothes...

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.260
Black eyes with a glowing vermilion pattern.

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:22.830
Oh, how delicious you look.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.730
Alpha Stigma, huh?

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:37.100
<i>Capital city of the Gastark Empire, Grenslade.</i>

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.280
<i>A tiny town like this</i>

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.710
<i>is the capital of the so-called strongest nation of the north continent,</i>

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.280
<i>the one that defeated Imperial Stohl?</i>

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:48.220
<i>And on top of that, monsters that devour people,</i>

00:07:48.220 --> 00:07:52.200
<i>creatures that spread destruction all over, descendants of heroes...</i>

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:57.490
<i>This place is filled with records of myths and legends.</i>

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.160
<i>A strange nation, indeed.</i>

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:03.120
<i>But thanks to that, I finally found what I was looking for.</i>

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:08.520
<i>This world has people with special powers, called Magic Eyes.</i>

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:14.240
<i>These people hold different respective symbols, depending on their abilities.</i>

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:17.480
<i>Ebra Crypt, which is said to gaze into the dreams of others.</i>

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.660
<i>Iino Doue, which is said to devour the lives of others.</i>

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:26.810
<i>And Alpha Stigma, which is said to analyze and comprehend all magic.</i>

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:30.950
<i>There's also Torch Curse and Will Hame.</i>

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:34.610
<i>At present, these are the five types that have been confirmed.</i>

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:40.460
<i>When Alpha Stigma bearers are born, they are no different from normal children.</i>

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:44.540
<i>It is said that their eyes can clearly see the truth of the world at a mere glance.</i>

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:47.970
<i>They read into the structures that spread through the atmosphere,</i>

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:50.350
<i>and instantly comprehend magical power.</i>

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:55.380
<i>There are also cases where something triggers them into going berserk.</i>

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:00.010
<i>They seek the destruction of truth, the erasure of all structure.</i>

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:04.850
<i>Once an Alpha Stigma bearer loses control, there is no return for them.</i>

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.060
<i>But...</i>

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.900
<i>Ryner came back.</i>

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:14.900
<i>What does that mean?</i>

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:18.160
<i>Does that mean that Ryner doesn't have an Alpha Stigma?</i>

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:21.280
<i>But, then...</i>

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.480
A goddess?

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:26.230
A broken, black hero, and a lonely demon?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.120
Man oh man, you're really into your studies there.

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.420
Riphal Edea?

00:09:35.350 --> 00:09:37.620
How about a little break?

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.300
I know!

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:43.860
I've got some good tea. Care for a taste?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.230
What are you doing here?

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:51.720
This is my country. What's so strange about me being here, as king?

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.150
But...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:57.110
I'm glad you could make it, Private Kiefer Knolles.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:01.910
Of course I'd at least want to know the name of the woman I've fallen for.

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.660
You researched me?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.200
Just your name.

00:10:07.940 --> 00:10:11.540
What good could possibly come from only knowing someone's name?

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.330
Flirting. Flirting, and taking to bed.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:19.190
My men wanted to look up your background, but I had them lay off.

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:24.060
After all, when you're hitting on a woman, it's only fun when it's straightforward.

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:28.480
Why do you think I came to your land?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:30.770
I could be a spy for another country, you know.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.330
I like to think I have an eye for women.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:34.190
Besides,

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:38.990
I thought we'd hit it off as two fools who hate war.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:44.240
<i>Of course I am! Where in this world would you find someone who likes war?!</i>

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.490
<i>I, too, hate war.</i>

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:54.420
Plus, this country has things you want to know.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.340
It's okay for you to just use us to your advantage, at first.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.760
Me, and this country.

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:14.560
In time, mark my words, I'll bring you around.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:21.850
That's some impressive confidence. But, before that...

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.340
Would you mind pouring me some tea?

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.090
With pleasure.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.290
This is...

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.860
It's definitely him.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:42.220
Your Excellency, over there!

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:00.780
It's him...

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:09.790
Finally, we meet... Finally!

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.200
He ate her?!

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.460
He consumed a human body?!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:23.060
Don't lose your head!

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:26.960
Get in formation! Prepare the large-scale magic!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:45.280
I can finally kill him! Kill that man!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.750
Ah, humans are so fragile.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:09.640
Well then, I'm through with my meal. I think I'll see myself out.

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:15.020
Do not falter! Continue the attack!

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:21.440
I have to go search for someone.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.570
I'd rather you stayed out of my way.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.430
Your Excellency!

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.610
Back him up! Let's go!

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:46.080
You're fast, for a human.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.350
I love meat with spirit.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:51.550
You're...

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:56.810
Oh, you've grown up so very delicious!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:00.650
You remember me, huh? Perfect!

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:04.860
I'll make you regret not killing me back then!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.410
He can win!

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:23.880
His Excellency the field marshal can win against that Alpha Stigma monster!

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:30.010
I suppose you're not bad, for a human.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:31.070
But...

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:31.910
I offer up this contract,

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:33.430
to unleash the magic beast of light which dances through...

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:36.640
This is for my friends! Die!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.800
...the skies!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.030
You're the one who's finished!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.520
I consume power...

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:49.020
...and unleash it!

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:07.170
Your Excellency!

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.270
Field Marshal!

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:11.550
Crimson-Fingered Claugh lost?!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.980
No good... Calm yourselves!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.400
Your Excellency! Are you all right?

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.400
Your Excellency! Your Excellency!

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:36.990
Ah, how truly... <i>truly</i>  glad I am that I left you alone back then!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.860
Amazing... I'm filled with power. With this...

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:46.200
With this, I could kill each and every last person here at once, without a trace!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:59.760
Stop pushing yourself, Your Excellency! We should retreat for now, and tend—

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:02.990
Let me go! I'm in no shape to run with this injury, anyway.

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:04.330
Your Excellency!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:08.020
This is an order! I'll hold that monster off.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.960
Use that time to withdraw the troops.

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:12.360
But that would mean...

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.630
I told you, it's an order!

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:18.190
If you won't follow it, I'll take your life, too.

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.080
Your Excellency...

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.870
Give my regards to Sion and Noa.

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:27.540
You...

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:31.550
Who would want to tell the princess anything about you?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:35.330
You little... son of a... Let me go!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.220
Look at that!

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:38.600
Protect His Excellency!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:41.430
Let His Excellency, Field Marshall Klom withdraw!

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:45.390
They're a bunch of damned fools!

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:51.710
You are, too. You Roland folk are all idiots. Truly foolish and good for nothing.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:53.910
I can't stand it, so I'll bail you out.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:57.410
Hey, you sons of bitches! Save those Roland fools!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.660
Prepare to fire the large-scale magic!

00:17:09.510 --> 00:17:13.090
If we fire that in a situation like this, we'll hit our own people.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:17.680
He should absorb the magic. That can buy us some time!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.800
Retreat!

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:36.690
Damn it...

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.620
Captain Milk!

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:50.380
Luke made you a delicious cake!

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:54.260
Please come out, Captain Milk!

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:59.340
<i>Ryner Lute departed from his inn this morning and hasn't been seen since.</i>

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.930
<i>After Captain Milk visited him.</i>

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:03.970
<i>That directive... </i>

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:08.720
<i>Maybe I was wrong to have shown it to him.</i>

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:15.800
I know that you're hiding. How about showing yourself?

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:23.780
So, what business might you have with me?

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.080
Milk Callaud is in our custody.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.880
Oh? And?

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:32.000
We'd like you to come with us, Luke Stokkart.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.580
And if I refuse?

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.590
Milk Callaud will not live.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:41.320
I see. I thought it was strange that Ryner Lute would take the captain with him.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:45.050
So that's it. The ones who abducted her were all of you.

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:47.030
And your aim was me?

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:50.480
What are you babbling on about? Come quietly!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.440
This is...

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.900
Yes, it's a Magic Trap.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:03.200
Ah, I'd recommend not moving.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.380
If you lift a foot, you'll be blown away without a trace.

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:13.030
After all, I'd rather not have fellow servants of Roland die.

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:14.350
How did you...?

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:16.500
I can tell from the way you carry yourself.

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:20.630
You're all people who received martial training in Roland.

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.860
And the person who has employed men like you,

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:28.520
who has abducted Milk Callaud, and who has business with me,

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:29.750
would likely be none other than...

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.060
...Miran Froaude.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.560
I'm impressed.

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:39.320
You've done your research on me, have you?

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.610
Lord Froaude, my deepest apol—

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:49.910
You are Lieutenant General Miran Froaude, I presume?

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:55.380
It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance, Sergeant Luke Stokkart.

00:19:55.380 --> 00:20:00.510
I'm well aware of your strength. Undefeated in twelve battles.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:04.010
And all in situations with numerical inferiority that should have spelled certain defeat.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.040
You've done impressive research,

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:09.640
considering that in most of those battles, I never gave my real name.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:14.100
It seems men of this caliber weren't even enough to properly test you.

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:16.820
Where is Captain Milk?

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:22.700
Before we discuss that, there is a favour I would ask of you.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:26.740
Please follow His Majesty's orders and kill Ryner Lute.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:35.540
I respectfully decline. That matter is none of your concern.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.110
Let there be darkness!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:20:59.760
Let there...

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:04.650
This is...

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:08.990
If you move any further, you'll be torn to shreds.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:43.190
Come to think of it, didn't I promise to carry the dumplings?

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:49.480
Ferris is probably pretty pissed.

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>Crap. I left in such a rush that now I'm almost out of money.</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:29.720
<i>Why do monetary economies even exist? This sucks!</i>

00:23:29.720 --> 00:23:32.860
<i>Ugh, I want to go to a world where I can just nap all the time.</i>

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:35.000
<i>I really, </i>really<i> want this.</i>
